                                "sense_id": "b577dd4c-1656-3b08-97b1-62476b6e5845",
                                "text": "With a population of nearly 94,000, Treviso impressed judges by transforming an abandoned landfill into a solar park, overhauling its canal system to improve water quality and launching biodiversity projects to clean its air."
